<p>I believe in being active in my community and local government. While not currently seeking office, I encourage everyone to stay informed. Check out <a class="fw-bold" href="https://citizenportal.ai/a/pbrq3z" rel="noopener" target="_blank">this AI-powered resource</a> to stay engaged!</p>
<p>Welcome to my <strong>Work in Progress</strong> ePortfolio! I'm excited that you're here. Please look around—by the time you finish, you'll have a great idea of who I am and what I can offer!</p>
</section>
